unt":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AI isn\u2019t foolproof and can sometimes generate inaccurate content, use outdated data, or hallucinate facts. Plus, there may be copyright or licensing issues depending on how and where you use AI tools. It\u2019s always wise to fact-check your output and understand legal boundaries before selling AI-generated work.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-with-ai\/#faq-question-1751030294625","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-with-ai\/#faq-question-1751030294625","name":"Can ChatGPT be used to earn income?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely! People are using ChatGPT to build chatbots, automate customer support, generate marketing content, write scripts, and even code. It\u2019s great for freelancers, small business owners, and anyone looking to streamline or offer digital services.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-with-ai\/#faq-question-1751030332786","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-with-ai\/#faq-question-1751030332786","name":"How can AI support your side hustle?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Think of AI as your digital assistant, which helps you work faster and smarter. You can write eBooks, generate social media content, create YouTube scripts or edit videos, all with the help of AI. It\u2019s perfect for turning weekend passion projects into extra income.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-with-ai\/#faq-question-1751030345478","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-with-ai\/#faq-question-1751030345478","name":"Can you sell AI-generated content?","answerCount":1,"acce